WEBVTT

00:09:24.829 --> 00:09:33.662
Woman to stop being so angry. And
the list goes on. It's attorney.

00:09:34.662 --> 00:09:36.829
It's a tyranny of positivity.

00:09:39.121 --> 00:09:47.746
And it's cruel. And kind. And ineffective.
And we do it ourselves.

00:09:48.621 --> 00:09:50.162
And we do it to others.

00:09:51.746 --> 00:09:58.037
If there's one common feature of brooding
bottling of positivity, it's this.

00:09:59.079 --> 00:10:01.412
They are all rigid responses.